{"at":"2026-11-27T04:09:34.349Z","date":"2026-11-29","word":"例える","id":1597130,"outcome":"ai","attempts":3,"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","verify_model":"claude-haiku-5-5","input_tokens":8768,"output_tokens":6522,"problems":[["definition_ja's second sentence「他のものと比べて話すことです。」is misleading. 例える means to liken something to something else as an analogy or figure of speech, not simply to compare (比べる/比較する) in general. The sentence blurs the word with 比べる, and it adds nothing beyond the first sentence."],["definition_ja is misleading: 例える means to compare or liken one thing to another (often a dissimilar thing, as in metaphor), not to explain something. The phrase 「似ている別のものの言葉を使って説明することです」 wrongly makes explanation the core meaning and requires similarity, and it is awkward Japanese for a learner."]]}
